{"id":"vod_sn_36308","vodId":"36308","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"异世界药局","name_cn":"异世界药局","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/36af4d5d48a5921f58568e42d5c87b47.jpg"},"summary":"药谷完治（丰崎爱生 配音）是一名现代日本药学研究者，哪知道在误打误撞之中，竟然转生来到了异世界，成为了宫廷药师名家的儿子法尔玛。这是一个无论是药学还是科技都落后于现代的世界，可是在这里，完治获得了只有这个世界才有了神奇魔力。　　于是，完治决定运用自己获得的能力，以及在原本世界里所拥有的药理学知识，来纠正存在于这个世界的对于治疗方法和药物调配的错误认知。在此过程中，完治邂逅了父亲的第一大弟子艾兰诺（上田丽奈 配音）以及和母亲一起侍奉自己家族的夏洛特（本渡枫 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ub2BZdaVKZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HH7E7Y62dj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JeU5Y2M7Xe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kCfxQH1eUW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7abcpzSrQK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QGih0AG1s11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PyGd2HMhPz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kRetKPkwJT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/99kR880q5h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C2URvxC9Yv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LW4bxpjN841/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/D2aPeeV0CP1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:24.187Z"}